58:Frozen W3.E application seam:
59:
60:- Add one typed `CatalogLibraryService` below React.
61:- `list()` calls `CatalogRepository.listCatalogs()` only and performs deterministic projection filtering/search/sort locally.
62:- `createBlank()` uses `createCatalogDocument(createId)`, persists through `CatalogRepository.createCatalog()`, validates the returned envelope, and only then returns the exact catalog ID for ordinary route opening.
63:- `rename()` fetches the authoritative full envelope only for the selected catalog, creates an ephemeral canonical `DocumentSession`, executes `document.rename`, and saves through `SaveCoordinator`; list projection updates only after authoritative acknowledgement.
64:- `archive()` fetches the selected authoritative envelope to establish current revision and then invokes canonical `archiveCAS`; no document mutation is used.
65:- Duplicate is represented only as a disabled/capability-gated affordance for W3.F.
66:- UI does not own revision arithmetic, document reconstruction, mutation IDs, or CAS retries.
